			"text": "## ⚡ Démo Énergétique\n$$P_L = u_L \\cdot i = (L\\frac{di}{dt}) \\cdot i$$\n$$E_m = \\int P_L dt = \\int Li \\, di$$\n$$\\boxed{E_m = \\frac{1}{2}Li^2}$$",
